       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">Every project runs through the same in-house team — no handing your story between\n        agencies. From concept and strategy through production to distribution, the people who\n        plan your shoot are the people who shoot it and cut it.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">Backed by Chilli, the Sunshine Coast marketing agency that's been growing businesses\n        since 1993, so your content lands as part of a strategy rather than in isolation.</p>",
